  "content_id": "16136199",
  "title": "Navigating Edge Wallet Exchange Scene",
  "description": "Navigation Access: You can reach this screen at any time by tapping Exchange from the bottom navigation bar. *Swipe your finger down to se...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Navigation Access:</b> You can reach this screen at any time by tapping <b>Exchange</b> from the bottom navigation bar. <b>*Swipe your finger down to see the full navigation bar and up to minimize it. </b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">The Exchange tab lets you swap one cryptocurrency for another directly inside the app, using integrated third-party providers.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>1. Select Source Wallet</b><br>Choose the crypto wallet you want to exchange from (e.g., BTC).</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>2. Select Receiving Wallet</b><br>Choose the destination wallet (e.g., ETH) to receive the converted funds.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>3. Review the Quote</b><br>Once both wallets are selected, Edge will display:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">The estimated amount you’ll receive</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Any provider fees</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Network fee details<br>Note: The amount shown is an estimate. Actual received funds may be slightly lower depending on network conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>4. Change Provider</b><br>Tap \"Powered by Thorchain\" (or other listed provider) to see available exchange partners and switch if desired.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>5. Slide to Confirm</b><br>When you're ready, slide the button to finalize the exchange.</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
